  id: PHOTO_QuanSent
  title: "B\u1EE9c \u1EA3nh cu\u1ED1i c\u1EE7a Julian"
  titleEn: Julian's Last Photograph
  year: 6
  body: "\u1EA2nh ch\u1EE5p flash s\xE0n nh\xE0 b\u1EBFp, g\u1EEDi \u0111\xEAm cu\u1ED1i
    c\xF9ng. Gi\u1EEFa v\u1EBFt b\u1EA9n hi\u1EC7n l\u1EDD m\u1EDD m\u1ED9t v\xF2ng
    tr\xF2n n\u0103m c\xE1nh b\u1EB1ng m\xE1u m\xE0 m\u1EAFt th\u01B0\u1EDDng kh\xF4ng
    th\u1EA5y."
  bodyEn: "A flash photo of the kitchen floor, sent on his last night. Inside the
    stain, faintly, a five-pointed circle drawn in blood \u2014 invisible to the
    naked eye."
  serif: 0
  flagOnCapture: 0
